{"id":"n42920-1-4","stage":4,"title":"노크 · 敲门","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42920-1-4-1","ko":"밖에 누구 왔나? 노크 소리가 들렸는데.","zh":"外面有谁来了吗？我听到敲门声了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밖에","meaning":"以外，之外","explanation":"밖：以外，之外；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"3","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}},{"text":"왔나?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔나","audio":"/audio/e928f4dfbdd4a6b1d413.mp3"}},{"text":"노크","meaning":"敲门，叩门","explanation":"노크：敲门，叩门","readings":[{"term":"노크","audio":"/audio/8af0dca3b81e76148f2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42920","senseId":"1","lemma":"노크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노크","audio":"/audio/8af0dca3b81e76148f2a.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"들렸는데.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들렸는데","audio":"/audio/0614d0543b134f733210.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"以外，之外","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不包含在某个范围或限度内的部分。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"8af0dca3b81e7614","term":"노크","zh":"敲门，叩门","audio":"/audio/8af0dca3b81e76148f2a.mp3","entryId":"42920","definition":"进屋前轻轻地拍打房门、发出动静的行为。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18a19e81fa1385577e7e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42920-1-4-2","ko":"제가 나가 볼게요.","zh":"我出去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"나가","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가","audio":"/audio/2ea9b6f2f116b0039a33.mp3"}},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게요